  <p>
    The top level is <code>tiny_attn_top</code>. A host loads Q, K and V into a model of off-chip memory, starts the engine,
    and reads back the output. Two interchangeable controllers drive one tile core. One selects the FLASH schedule, and the
    other the NAIVE schedule.
  </p>
